lor: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">そろそろGWの<ruby>宿題<rt>しゅくだい</rt></ruby>やらないと！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-05-05/25146_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7745.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>は<ruby>短<rt>みじか</rt></ruby>めですが！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>暦<rt>こよみ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>上<rt>うえ</rt></ruby>ではもう<ruby>夏<rt>なつ</rt></ruby>です。<ruby>次第<rt>しだい</rt></ruby>に<ruby>暑<rt>あつ</rt></ruby>くなりますが、どうかお<ruby>体<rt>からだ</rt></ruby><ruby>大切<rt>たいせつ</rt></ruby>になさって<ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さい。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">see you later&nbsp;✩*.ﾟ#18</span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n                    ",
